 relative; display: flex; width: 1140px;\" data-id=\"edbc831\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap elementor-element-populated\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; display: flex; width: 1140px; padding: 10px;\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 1120px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-content: flex-start; display: flex;\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21f6cd2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 1120px;\" data-id=\"21f6cd2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Guangzhou Medical University is a high level research-oriented institution with a national priority in Western China&rsquo;s development. It is directly subordinated by the administration of the Ministry of Education. We are and have always been committed to providing a stellar education and excels in the field of bringing strong rapports between faculty members and our students along with upgrading the quality of our teaching curriculum. Changsha University of Science and Technology scholarship is available to students from countries alongst to the &ldquo;The Belt and Road&rdquo; region , as well as students from countries along the 21 Century Maritime Silk Road. The purpose of this scholarship is to provide international students the opportunity to experience China&rsquo;s flourishing culture while obtaining or making progress on their degree,with a goal to promote cooperation, inclusiveness and mutual understanding between China and other countries.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-63fdd63 elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 1287px; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s; left: 0px;\" data-id=\"63fdd63\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;,&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-narrow\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; margin-right: auto; margin-left: auto; position: relative; max-width: 1140px; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center;\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-row\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 1140px; display: flex;\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ef9a9ce\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 1px; position: relative; display: flex; width: 1140px;\" data-id=\"ef9a9ce\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap elementor-element-populated\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; display: flex; width: 1140px; padding: 5px;\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 1130px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-content: center; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\r\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-f32b2cd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 1130px; t