dget elementor-widget-text-editor\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 1110px;\" data-id=\"730ae0d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #555555; font-family: Helvetica, Tahoma, Verdana, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\">Established in 1958, Ningxia Medical University is a non-profit public higher-education institution located in the urban setting of the metropolis of Yinchuan (population range of 1,000,000-5,000,000 inhabitants), Ningxia. Officially recognized by the Department of Education of the Ningxia Hui Autonomous Region, Ningxia Medical University (NXMU) is a medium-sized (uniRank enrollment range: 8,000-8,999 students) coeducational Chinese higher education institution. Ningxia Medical University (NXMU) offers courses and programs leading to officially recognized higher education degrees such as bachelor degrees in several areas of study. See the uniRank degree levels and areas of study matrix below for further details. International applicants are eligible to apply for enrollment. NXMU also provides several academic and non-academic facilities and services to students including a library, financial aids and/or scholarships, as well as administrative services.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5aa9cd3 