t: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>', 'NANTONG UNIVERSITY', 'nantong-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/44_1690110149.jpg', '2023-05-20 17:13:11', '2023-12-03 01:38:22', NULL, 1),
(45, 3, '<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', tahoma, arial, 宋体; font-size: 13px; background-color: #ffffff; text-align: justify;\">Nanjing Medical University is an institution of higher learning with a glorious history and excellent traditions. As early as 1941, it became one of the first institutions in China to admit graduate students. It was also one of the first medical colleges in China to offer six-year medical education programs, and one of the first to be authorized to confer doctoral and master\'s degrees in China, as well.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', tahoma, arial, 宋体; font-size: 13px; background-color: #ffffff; text-align: justify;\">Today the university is a modern medical education institution with a complete range of disciplines, a strong faculty, and first class research capacities. It has seven first-level discipline doctoral programs, eleven first-level discipline master\'s programs, and six postdoctoral research centers. Its degree programs cover seven disciplines &ndash; medicine, science, technology, management, law, education, and literature. The university has three state-level key disciplines and one key discipline for state-level cultivation. It also has one academician from the Chinese Academy of Engineering and one state key laboratory.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', tahoma, arial, 宋体; font-size: 13px; background-color: #ffffff; text-align: justify;\">In the past eight decades, the university has cultivated a great number of medical and health care talents and made an enduring contribution to the health cause of humankind.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', tahoma, arial, 宋体; font-size: 13px; background-color: #ffffff; text-align: justify;\">In the new century, the university aims to become one of the highest grade medical universities, with distinctive features and international fame; and it will strive to make even more outstanding contributions in medical education, research, service, and culture.</p>', 'Nanjing Medical University', 'nanjing-medical-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/45_1690109890.jpg', '2023-05-20 17:20:27', '2023-07-23 20:58:10', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `post_author`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_name`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`, `image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `status`) VALUES
(46, 1, '<h4 style=\"margin: 48.875px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', iconfont; font-weight: 400; transition: all 0.5s ease 0s; color: #4b4b4b; text-align: justify;\">Located in the historic city of Xi\'an, cradle of Chinese civilization and terminus of the ancient Silk Road, Northwestern Polytechnical University (NPU) is the only multidisciplinary and research-oriented in China that is simultaneously developing education and research programs in the fields of aeronautics, astronautics, and marine technology engineering. It is now affiliated to the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT). Since the establishment of the People\'s Republic of China (PRC), NPU has always been one of the nation&rsquo;s key universities. In 1960 it was approved as a state key university by the State Council. It ranked among China&rsquo;s top 15 universities in the state&rsquo;s 7th and 8th Five-Year plans; and NPU is one of the first 22 universities to have established a graduate school. It was one of the first universities to enter into the 211 Project in 1995 and the 985 Project in 2001. NPU is a member of the \"Outstanding University Alliance\" program and is honored as a National Role Model Unit, a National Pioneer for Optimal Advanced Basic-level Party Organization and a Model University for Graduate Employment etc. NPU adheres to the motto \" Loyalty，Integrity，Courage and Perseverance\" while carrying forward the spirit of \" Strong Preparation，Diligent Effort，Practical Attitude，and Creative Innovation\". NPU has put its roots down in the west; dedicated itself to national defense and written several &ldquo;firsts&rdquo; into the history of the PRC. Now NPU will continue to pioneer new pathways into the future in the process of building a world first-class university and world first-class disciplines.</h4>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 22.0pt; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Northwestern&nbsp;Polytechnical&nbsp;University</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Full Free Undergraduate Offer with Monthly Stipend for September Intake-2024</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">World&nbsp;Rank</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">:&nbsp;333</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Chinese&nbsp;Academic&nbsp;Rank:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;19</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Location:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #202124; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Xi\'an, Shaanxi, China</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Teaching:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\"> English</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Scholarship Coverage:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">NPU&nbsp;Presidential&nbsp;Scholarship.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Segoe UI Symbol\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Segoe UI Symbol\';\">❤ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">1st&nbsp;Prize:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Tuition: Free</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Hostel: Free</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Stipend: 1500 RMB/Month </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Segoe UI Symbol\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Segoe UI Symbol\';\">❤</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\"> 2nd&nbsp;Prize:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;Tuition: Free 🤎</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Majors </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aerospace&nbsp;Engineering</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Naval&nbsp;Architecture&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Marine&nbsp;Engineering</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Materials&nbsp;Science&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Engineering</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Mechanical&nbsp;Design,&nbsp;Manufacturing&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Automation&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Civil&nbsp;Engineering</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Electronics&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Information&nbsp;Engineering</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Computer&nbsp;Science&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Technology</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">8.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Business&nbsp;Administration</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">9.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Microelectronic&nbsp;Science&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Engineering</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">10.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Biotechnology</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">11.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; English</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Requirements:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">1. Passport </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">2. All Academic Certificate and Transcript </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">3. Study Plan </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">4. Physical Examination Report </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">5. Police Clearance</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">6. Bank Statement</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">7. Language Proficiency (IELTS/Duolingo) </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">8. Digital Photo</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Contact us for more details.<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break; page-break-before: always;\" clear=\"all\" /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">========================</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>North western Polytechnical University 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Chinese Government Scholarship Type A and B</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>President scholarships NPU</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Xian belt and road Scholarship&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Undergraduate, Master Degree,PhD Degree&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Undergraduates scholarship with stipend&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>English taught program available&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>IELTS MANDATORY FOR UNDERGRADUATE&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Application fee:600 RMB</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Application links:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>https://admission.nwpu.edu.cn/</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Application Period:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>The first batch: November 1, 2024 - December 31, 2024, 17:00 (GMT+8).&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Application submission after 17:00 (GMT+8) is automatically regarded as 2nd batch application.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>The second batch: January 1, 2025 -&nbsp; January 31, 2025, 17:00 (GMT+8).&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Application submission after 17:00 (GMT+8) is automatically regarded as 3rd batch application.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>The third batch: February 1, 2025 - February 28, 2025, 17:00 (GMT+8).&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Application submission after 17:00 (GMT+8) is automatically regarded as 4th batch application.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>The fourth batch: March 1, 2025 - April 15, 2025, 17:00 (GMT+8).</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Application submission after April 15, 2025, 17:00 (GMT+8) is automatically regarded as giving up.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>CSC Type B Scholarship application deadline is January 31, 2025, 17:00 (GMT+8). Applicants are encouraged to apply early to have a higher chance of receiving a scholarship.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>Scholarship details:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>1. https://studyat.nwpu.edu.cn/info/1184/3541.htm (undergraduate)</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>2. https://studyat.nwpu.edu.cn/info/1303/3791.htm&nbsp; &nbsp; (Master)</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><strong>3. https://studyat.nwpu.edu.cn/info/1313/3781.htm (Phd)</strong></span></span></p>', 'Northwestern Polytechnical University', 'northwestern-polytechnical-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/46_1690109707.jpg', '2023-05-20 17:30:25', '2024-10-31 22:50:27', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `post_author`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_name`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`, `image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `status`) VALUES
(47, 1, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">HISTORY AND&nbsp;</span></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">STATUS QUO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Nanjing University of Information Science &amp; Technology (NUIST), founded in 1960 and renamed from Nanjing Institute of Meteorology in 2004, was designated as one of the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">national&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">key institutions of higher&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">education</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;in 1978. NUIST is co-constructed by the Jiangsu Provincial People&rsquo;s Government,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">China Meteorological Administration (CMA)</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">, the State Oceanic Administration&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">(</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">SOA</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">)</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">and&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">the Ministry of Education.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">In 2017, NUIST</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;is on the list of China&rsquo;s &ldquo;Double First-class&rdquo; construction universities and disciplines as well as Jiangsu high level universities.</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">In recent years, NUIST\'s comprehensive ranking in the international mainstream university rankings has risen rapidly.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">In 202</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">2</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">, it ranked&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">around</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">&nbsp;5</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">0</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">th among&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">Chinese mainland</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">&nbsp;universities&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">and 900</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">th</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">among world universities&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">in the four major global university rankings of Times, U.S. News, ARWU, and QS.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-indent: 36px; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">ADVANTAGEOUS DISCIPLINES</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-setting