(60, 3, '<div class=\"\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div id=\":r16c:\" class=\"x1iorvi4 x1pi30zi x1l90r2v x1swvt13\" style=\"padding: 4px 16px 16px; font-family: inherit;\" data-ad-comet-preview=\"message\" data-ad-preview=\"message\">\r\n<div class=\"x78zum5 xdt5ytf xz62fqu x16ldp7u\" style=\"margin-top: -5px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: -5px; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div class=\"xu06os2 x1ok221b\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tba/1.5/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>Unconditional 4 years Bachelor SCHOLARSHIP<span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta9/1.5/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta9/1.5/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>AR EDU <span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tbd/1.5/16/1f91d.png\" alt=\"🤝\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tbd/1.5/16/1f91d.png\" alt=\"🤝\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>ZZU<span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta9/1.5/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">We are thrilled to share some incredible updates with you all! AR EDUCATION - Educational Consultancy has been working closely with ZHENGZHOU UNIVERSITY for five years, and we are proud to be their exclusive partner from Bangladesh.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Last month, we had the honor of visiting their beautiful campus and signing a new agreement, further strengthening our partnership. Zhengzhou University also sent us some amazing gifts, which we are grateful for from the bottom of our hearts.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">As the third largest university in Asia, Zhengzhou University offers exceptional scholarships for students. We are dedicated to empowering aspiring students and are excited about the future of our collaboration.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta5/1.5/16/1f449_1f3fb.png\" alt=\"👉🏻\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>World Ranking-330 (CWUR)<span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta9/1.5/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Thank you, Zhengzhou University, for your trust and support. Together, we are shaping a brighter future through education!</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tba/1.5/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>Unconditional 4 years Bachelor Scholarship!</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf3/1.5/16/2764.png\" alt=\"❤️\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>Scholarship Coverage: Tuition Fee Full Free<span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta9/1.5/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1.5/16/1f393.png\" alt=\"🎓\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>Major&rsquo;s:</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">1. Civil Engineering</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">2. Software Engineering</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">3. Pharmacy</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">4. International trade <span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta9/1.5/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">WhatsApp. <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x6umtig x1b1mbwd xaqea5y xav7gou x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xt0b8zv x1fey0fg\" style=\"cursor: pointer; text-decoration-line: none; outline: none; list-style: none; margin: 0px; text-align: inherit; padding: 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline; font-family: inherit; border: 0px initial initial;\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://wa.me/message/SEE5UHEBZMKUO1?fbclid=IwAR1Iq2Zz9wO6m14uRN5x-_IbQi0v-SO-Th5jFYpPRSsZvZdWb8UDP421L1c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://wa.me/message/SEE5UHEBZMKUO1</a></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: inherit;\">\r\n<div dir