errat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">(1) Non-Chinese citizens in good health, applicants must be a citizen from countries along the Belt and Road.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">(2) No more than 25 years old when applying for bachelor programs with high school certification.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">(3) Language requirements: HSK 5, admitted Applicants who do not meet the language requirement will be arranged one-year Chinese language course covered by the scholarship. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">(4) Not entitled to other Chinese government scholarships simultaneously.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Requirement&rsquo;s</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Passpor