;s </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Scholarship Coverage:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Tuition: Half (7,500 RMB have to pay)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Hostel: Half (1800 RMB have to pay)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">(From 2nd -4Th year Tuition Free Full Free)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Major&rsquo;s:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; International Trade &amp; Economics</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Marketing </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Civil Engineering </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">Requirement&rsquo;s</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Passport (10 Pages)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Picture (White Background)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; All Academic Certificates &amp; Transcripts (Notarized)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Police Clearance</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Physical Examination Report</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Language Proficiency</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Bank Statement</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">8.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Recommendation Letter (From High School)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Montserrat; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">For More Details, Contact with us</span></strong></p>', 'Xian Technological University', 'xian-technological-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023-12-02 20:46:24', '2023-12-02 20:46:24', NULL, 1),
(96, 1, '<p>Bachelor Degree Partial Scholarship in March Intake, 2024 in Wuzhou University&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>❇️Location: Wuzhou, Guangxi (Close to Guangzhou)&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>❇️Teaching: English&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tuition and Hostel: 6000 RMB</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Majors:</p>\r\n<p>1. International trade and economics&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2. Supply chain management&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>3. Computer science and technology&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>4. Mechanical Engineering&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>5. Pharmaceutical Engineering&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>6. Electronics Engineering&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From 2nd to 4th have different kind of scholarship!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Wuzhou University', 'wuzhou-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023-12-17 16:18:52', '2023-12-17 16:18:52', NULL, 1),
